{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1732.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4c31086174acce03008dbe2783c5f0fc221c84e085a9da0839fedb407242ca95","ja":"このコーナーでは、出されたお題に合わせて、\n私たちが制限時間内に『映える』ポーズをします！","zh":"在这个环节中，我们会配合给出的题目，\n在时限内摆出“上镜”的姿势！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1732.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2a3085153053d299619b64713602e41e23df003e85b1066035c3113b0f66c484","ja":"お題に合っているか判定してもらったあとは、なんと！\n撮影タイムがありますよ～！","zh":"判定是否符合主题之后，竟然还有！\n拍照时间哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
