{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1732.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"3cd6fecb55fd2e950d4eaa9b50566c442b8b96768dc61e877917837db33db05c","ja":"写真はSNSにアップしていいんだって！\nみんな、『最高の瞬間』をアップしてね～っ！！","zh":"照片可以发到社交平台上哦！\n大家快把“最精彩的瞬间”发上去吧～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1732.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"e128027c75af562bf4037f8ed119987caefffcb97c835d390d65d44247f8b0b7","ja":"では、最初のお題は……。","zh":"那么，第一个题目是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1732.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"0512100fe39ec7ca33abc5af1802b92de90b8d442f21fe64457bc18f5e036aed","ja":"えーっと……『ファンサービスになる』ポーズです！\nどうしようかな……あっ。","zh":"那个……是“回馈粉丝”的姿势！\n该怎么办呢……啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1732.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"f3583ddda936929697a531c81bea7066ca5079070baf3e87d32cf4bc4947a044","ja":"じゃあ、まずは私から！\n美味しい炒飯、作っちゃいますよ～♪","zh":"那就先从我开始吧！\n我要做美味的炒饭喽～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1732.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"37029bd62c404c46dcc9d1ecc38f411d65abeb1746474886e289bf6f944f5158","ja":"まるで本当に、中華鍋を振っている\nみたいですね！　では、私は……。","zh":"简直就像真的在颠炒锅\n一样呢！那么，我来……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1732.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"13ecb8cf140a801f1209482abcca52d5771c6e8ac0e7f7af209d173b72cb7f4e","ja":"大和撫子らしい丁寧なお辞儀を……\nいかがでしょうか？","zh":"像大和抚子一样行个端正的躬……\n您意下如何？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1732.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"75ed6c9fa2e47d76da6f970140598c74c14e9af80595b4c03586e4f89c811cf0","ja":"「お見事！　おふたりともポーズ判定合格です。\nではこのまま、撮影してもらいましょう！」","zh":"“太棒了！两位摆出的姿势都合格了。\n那么就保持这样，让他们开始拍摄吧！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1732.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"aec81a75bc9a041498de09758bf4a000b097bed6d54fc0d77e0a15dca4f6d796","ja":"えへへ。それじゃあ、も～っとたくさん、\nエア炒飯作っちゃいますね♪","zh":"嘿嘿。那么，我还要做～更多更多的\n空气炒饭哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1732.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"a2637f2f62dec413049a7dcecd472620df9c463d0923ef7e762087f77f0a845c","ja":"どうぞ撮影、よろしくお願いいたします♪","zh":"接下来拍摄就拜托大家了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
